From fda1451bf6afd0b043a7a14fe555239aa181ffd1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:22:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Hold return_on_capital as DEFINITION_PENDING

Its capital base (debt + equity, or net working capital + net fixed
assets) needs an accounting decision; it is no longer emitted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
